{
  "description": "Exposes al_reviewinstance to the portal Web API so the review page can request a submission. Paired with a one-column allowlist: the only writable column is al_submitrequested, which SubmitRequestPlugin reads. A Custom API cannot be called from a page and this replaces the cloud flow that used to bridge that gap.",
  "value": "true"
}
